## Runtime services

These are not redistributed with this repository — you bring the service, or
you use the public one.

| Service | Terms | Note |
|---|---|---|
| [Google Maps Platform](https://developers.google.com/maps/terms) | Google Maps Platform Terms | Requires your own API key and Map ID. Attribution must read "Map data ©2026 Google". |
| [OpenStreetMap](https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright) | ODbL 1.0 | The POI ingest reads OSM data. Attribution is required: "© OpenStreetMap contributors". |
| [whereq.cloud](https://whereq.cloud) | Metered API | The Data API. Public preview access is limited; a key unlocks the full dataset. |

## Fonts

No font files are bundled in this repository. The frontend loads Geist, Geist
Mono, Inter and Space Grotesk from a CDN; all four are SIL Open Font License
1.1.

## Data

No third-party dataset is redistributed in this repository. See
